][If] you are[ my] mother, stop[ reading][ this][ post] now[...] if you are not[ my] mother[,] check out this crazy photo[ of][ Monte][z][ Bill][ings] trying to leap over the cameraman![ haha], gotta[ be] quick on[ your] feet!

